        ["What is the difference between `cProfile` and the legacy pure-Python `profile` module?", "What is the difference between `tottime` and `cumtime`?"],
        ["Running `cProfile` on high-concurrency async code without accounting for coroutine context switches.", "Confusing cumulative time with total time when hunting for leaf function bottlenecks."],
        "Focus on `tottime` to find slow computational leaf functions; focus on `cumtime` to find high-level architectural bottlenecks.",
